      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra is wild in this AU, Adora is a commander. it's not technically the original She-ra universe here. My oc Silver is mentioned but doesn't have too much of a huge impact of the story, not like my other stories have been.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
